Copyright (c) Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.

The files here are a KiCad conversion of Espressif's original OrCAD/Allegro
design data, with fixes to the import (see README.md). The original
design data is Espressif's Camera Adapter Board reference design package:
https://dl.espressif.com/schematics/CameraAdapterBoardReferenceDesign.zip

The conversion does not change who owns the design, and this repository
